    <briefdescription>
<para>Represents a single state within the app&apos;s finite state machine. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Subscribers attach behaviour to OnStateEnter, OnStateUpdate, and OnStateExit and StateMachine calls Enter, Update, and Exit to drive those callbacks. </para>
